{
  "name": "apple-style",
  "description": "Apple-style year: ends on the last Saturday of September, weeks start Sunday, named by end year. The quarter pattern (13-week quarters, periods 4-4-5, extra week in period 1 so that the first quarter has 14 weeks in a 53-week year) is illustrative of Apple's first-quarter placement, not Apple's actual internal month pattern. Two-digit year labels resolve through century_pivot 2069, so FY69 is 2069 and FY70 is 1970.",
